      "en": "If then you were raised together with Christ, seek the things that are above, where Christ is, seated on the right hand of God.",
      "ko": "그러므로 너희가 그리스도와 함께 다시 살리심을 받았으면 위엣 것을 찾으라 거기는 그리스도께서 하나님 우편에 앉아 계시느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "a87421b8aec536355d73d46b9107fa4869579947d8005a3ad2ab8cee5a901fd7",
      "translation_text_hash": "385d5e4c8c4d9e00cb8b7f7e77af110b3c66d49d0bb8d7626251d15f88a663de",
