      "en": "When Christ, our life, is revealed, then you will also be revealed with him in glory.",
      "ko": "우리 생명이신 그리스도께서 나타나실 그 때에 너희도 그와 함께 영광 중에 나타나리라",
      "source_text_hash": "dec96e5df4c8a7cc8e2bcdb33408d47dc6f6a95cdb145a438ab92e3f477cea33",
      "translation_text_hash": "4220d23587ca1a8e51739cffa1d40990d69fbdc0dab2b97c8c4526f9909e702d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
